  "briefing": "You have entered Cave K, the Shrine of Evil Chaos — the dark epicenter of malevolence in the Borderlands. Torches flicker with eerie violet flame along black stone pillars. Incense heavy with brimstone stings your throat. In the crypt alcoves, the dead stir, and before the blood-stained altar, the Evil Priest of Chaos chants blasphemous hymns. Destroy the cult, rescue the captives, and recover the Eye of Chaos to save the realm!",
